#: _translatorinfo.cpp:1
msgid ""
"_: NAME OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your names"
msgstr "Owain Green ar ran KGyfieithu - Meddalwedd Gymraeg"

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:3
msgid ""
"_: EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your emails"
msgstr "kyfieithu@dotmon.com"

#: email.cpp:85
msgid "KDE Email Control Module"
msgstr "Modwl Rheoli Ebost KDE"

#: email.cpp:86
msgid "Configure your identity, email addresses, mail servers, etc."
msgstr "Ffurweddu'ch dynodiad, cyfeiriadau ebost, gweinyddion post, ayyb."

#: email.cpp:88
msgid "Current maintainer"
msgstr "Cynhaliwr cyfredol"

#: email.cpp:191
msgid "New Email Profile"
msgstr "Proffil Ebost Newydd"

#: email.cpp:198
msgid "Name:"
msgstr "Enw:"

#: email.cpp:219
msgid "Please enter a name for the profile."
msgstr "Rhowch enw i'r proffil."

#: email.cpp:221
msgid "This email profile already exists, and cannot be created again."
msgstr ""
"Mae'r proffil ebost yma'n bodoli eisioes, ac nid oes modd ei greu eilwaith."

#: email.cpp:295
msgid ""
"<h1>Email</h1> This module allows you to enter basic email information for the "
"current user. The information here is used, among other things, for sending bug "
"reports to the KDE developers when you use the bug report dialog."
"<p> Note that email programs like KMail offer many more features, but they "
"provide their own configuration facilities."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Ebost</h1> Galluoga'r modwl yma i chi roi gwybodaeth ebost sylfaenol ar "
"gyfer y defnyddiwr cyfredol. Defnyddir y wybodaeth yma, ymysg sawl peth arall, "
"i anfon adroddiadau namau at ddatblygwyr KDE pan ddefnyddiwch yr ymgom adrodd "
"namau. "
"<p>Noder bod rhaglenni ebost fel KMail yn cynnig llawer rhagor o nodweddion ond "
"eu bod yn darparu eu adnoddau ffurfweddu eu hunain."

#: email.cpp:314
msgid "Do you wish to discard changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "A ydych am daflu'r newidiadau i'r proffil cyfredol?"

#: email.cpp:315
msgid "Do you wish to save changes to the current profile?"
msgstr "A ydych am gadw'r newidiadau i'r proffil cyfredol?"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Ebost"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "User Information"
msgstr "Gwybodaeth Defnyddiwr"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"You can set a reply address if you want replies to your email messages to go to "
"a different address than the email address above. Most likely, you should leave "
"the reply address blank, so replies go to the email address you entered above."
"<p><em> Please note:</em> "
"<ul>"
"<li>You do not need to enter the same email address as above.</li>"
"<li>You should not use a reply address if you frequently use discussion mailing "
"lists.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Gallwch osod cyfeiriad ymateb os ydyach am i atebion i'ch negeseuon ebost i "
"fynd at gyfeiriad gwahanol i'r cyfeiriad ebost uchod. Mwy na thebyg, dylech "
"adael y cyfeiriad ateb yn wag, fel yr â atebion at y cyfeiriad ebost y rhoddoch "
"uchod."
"<p><em>Noder:</em> "
"<ul>"
"<li>Nid oes angen i chi roi'r un cyfeiriad ag uchod yma.</li>"
"<li>Ni ddylech ddefnyddio cyfeiriad ateb os ydych yn defnyddio rhestrau ebost "
"trafod yn aml."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"Enter your email address here, e.g. \"john@doe.com\" (without the quotation "
"marks). This information is mandatory if you want to use email."
"<p>\n"
"Do <em>not</em> enter something like John Doe &lt;john@doe.com&gt;\", just a "
"plain email address. Your email address must not contain any blank spaces."
msgstr ""
"Rhowch eich cyfeiriad ebost yma, e.e. \"owain@glyndwr.com\" (heb y dyfynnodau). "
"Mae'r wybodaeth hon yn angenrheidiol os ydych am ddefnyddio ebost."
"<p>\n"
"<em>Peidiwch</em> â rhoi rhywbeth fel \"Owain Glyndwr "
"&lt;owain@glyndwr.com&gt;\" dim ond cyfeiriad ebost plaen. Rhaid bod dim "
"gofodau gwag yn eich cyfeiriad ebost."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Organi&zation:"
msgstr "&Sefydliad:"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Reply-&to address:"
msgstr "Cyfeiriad &ateb:"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid ""
"Here you can enter the name of your organization, company or university. This "
"field is <em>optional</em>. However, if you are using a business account and "
"communicate with persons working for other companies, providing the name of "
"your organization is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Yma gallwch roi enw'ch sefydliad, eich cwmni neu'ch prifysgol. Mae'r maes yn "
"<em>ddewisol</em>. Serch hynny, os ydych yn defnyddio cyfrif busnes ac yn "
"cyfathrebu â phobl sy'n gweithio i gwmnïau eraill, fe argymellir rhoi enw'ch "
"sefydliad."

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "E&mail address:"
msgstr "Cyfeiriad e&bost:"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"Enter your full name here, e.g. \"John Doe\" (without the quotation\n"
"marks). Some people like to provide a nickname only. You can leave this field "
"blank and still use email. However, providing your full name is <em>"
"recommended</em> as this makes it much easier for your recipient to browse his "
"or her email."
msgstr ""
"Rhowch eich enw llawn yma, e.e. \"Owain Glyndwr\" (heb y dyfynnodau).\n"
"Mae'n well gan rai bobl roi ffugenw'n unig. Gallwch adael y maes yma'n wag a "
"dal i ddefnyddio ebost. Serch hynny, mae rhoi'ch enw llawn yn <em>"
"argymelledig</em> gan fo hyn yn ei gwneud hi'n llawer haws i'ch derbynnydd bori "
"ei (h)ebost."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Full &name:"
msgstr "Enw llaw&n:"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "SMTP server:"
msgstr "Gweinydd SMTP:"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<qt>You can specify the server to send mail to here.\n"
"<br>"
"<br> SMTP means Simple Mail Transfer Protocol and is the standard way to send "
"mail.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Gallwch benodi'r gweinydd i anfon ebost iddo yma.\n"
"<br>"
"<br> Golyga SMTP \"Protocol Syml ar gyfer Trosglwyddo Ebost\" (Simple Mail "
"Transfer Protocol), a ffordd safonol i anfon ebost yw e. </qt>"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "C&urrent profile:"
msgstr "Proffil c&yfredol:"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "&New Profile..."
msgstr "Proffil &Newydd..."
